    - Term: BricksInfoText
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Move the cloud to do the ball bounces and hits the bricks . When a brick
        within a piece of furniture is broken the piece of furniture is placed in
        its place.

        Color proression of a brick before break:'
      - "Mueve la nube para  hacer que la bola rebote y golpee los ladrillos. Cuando
        rompes un ladrillo que contiene un mueble el mueble se coloca en su sitio.\nProgresi\xF3n
        de colores de un ladrillo antes de romperse:"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
